{{!--
  A die drawn as its polyhedral shape.

  Expects: faces
  Optional: value  -- the rolled result, shown large beside the shape

  The shape carries the size, so no "d8" text is needed. A small numeral rides alongside
  it because d8, d10, and d12 outlines are hard to tell apart at this size.

  MODDERS: glyphs are mapped in SSS.DIE_ICONS (module/config.mjs) and resolved by the
  sssDieIcon Handlebars helper.
--}}
<span class="sss-shape" aria-hidden="true">
    <i class="fa-solid {{sssDieIcon faces}}" inert></i>
    <span class="sss-shape-size">{{faces}}</span>
</span>
